(7478652, 1188952, 182284, '<td valign="top">Thank you for your votes and comments. I''m really surprised it did as well as it did. I thought the colors were a bit over done. Didn''t notice until I uploaded it, And yes from my garden. I love heirloom  vegetables that are chemical free. I''ve been growing heirlooms since 1998.</td>', 'Thank you for your votes and comments. I''m really surprised it did as well as it did. I thought the colors were a bit over done. Didn''t notice until I uploaded it, And yes from my garden. I love heirloom  vegetables that are chemical free. I''ve been growing heirlooms since 1998.', '2016-10-17 13:22:38.000000', NULL, 0),
